{"resource":"lines/ms-computer-supplies","about":"One budget line, every year and stage a document states it.","count":11,"caveats":["A STAGE IS NOT A PERIOD. There is no join between this table and `ledger_snapshot` and nothing should invent one.","An \"actual\" here is a RESTATEMENT: a prior year re-presented by the people who spent it, inside the argument for the next budget. It is not a ledger figure.","These lines do NOT sum back to the district totals -- between 0.1% and 1.6% out. Never apportion a total across them.","`documents_disagree` marks a figure two documents state differently. The documents disagree with themselves by up to 1.5%, which is larger than most variances anybody wants to measure.","FY2021 is unusable: 117 of 120 lines print the budget under an \"actual\" heading. Exclude it."],"provenance":{"documents":[{"doc_id":"sources/district-budget-page/text/budget-hearing-fy20-proposed-lps-budget.txt","path":"sources/district-budget-page/text/budget-hearing-fy20-proposed-lps-budget.txt","basis":"both","url":null,"copy_state":null,"sha256":"096ff134aee4c3b815e351af694dd154722db98a007fd24748a7961c57af5e79","cited_as":"budget-hearing-fy20-proposed-lps-budget.txt"},{"doc_id":"sources/district-budget-page/text/fy18-non-personnel-supt-recommended-budget-revised-6-6-17.txt","path":"sources/district-budget-page/text/fy18-non-personnel-supt-recommended-budget-revised-6-6-17.txt","basis":"budget","url":null,"copy_state":null,"sha256":"75207f164c59ec20ed6e8007059c245f4a9cf73d74dc9bc8b394298362d76a6b","cited_as":"fy18-non-personnel-supt-recommended-budget-revised-6-6-17.txt"},{"doc_id":"sources/district-budget-page/text/fy19-final-report.txt","path":"sources/district-budget-page/text/fy19-final-report.txt","basis":"both","url":null,"copy_state":null,"sha256":"f558c52c0d1704dc404ab7b9b015726744c2538210d77472ed897d0ad1cf1ca0","cited_as":"fy19-final-report.txt"},{"doc_id":"sources/district-budget-page/text/fy26-school-dept-approved-budget-3-12-25.txt","path":"sour